      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hey Minchan,\n\nThanks for spotting this.  __GFP_CMA shouldn\u0027t be placed into alloc_flags (unless you know otherwise), and with the introduction of my patch here (https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/+/1493978), ALLOC_CMA being set implies __GFP_CMA is set.  So, let\u0027s check for alloc_flags \u0026 ALLOC_CMA instead.\n\nThanks,\n\nChris.",
      "revId": "4b584c6492b6b893a9eaf31b418f14f83e2a6367",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
